+    /* VP_ATTRS_TEX=<hex>[,<hex>...]: only draws whose texture unit 0 is one of
+     * these raw offsets (as RSX_CAP manifests print them, e.g. 04EEE600). J-Stars
+     * copies every fragment program into a ring, so VP_ATTRS_FP cannot follow
+     * one effect; its textures are stable. Matching draws skip the layout
+     * dedup (up to VP_ATTRS_N, default 12, are printed) and also show every
